<title>USA: Price Waterhouse to do accounts for BP unit.</title>
<headline>Price Waterhouse to do accounts for BP unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price Waterhouse LLP said on Friday it assumed responsibility for finance and accounting services for British Petroleum Co Plc unit BP Exploracion de Venezuela, as part of a strategic alliance in Latin America.</p>
<p>Price Waterhouse took responsibility for a similar service for BP Exploration Colombia in May. The company said in a statement the two agreements had a total value of $25 million over the next five years.</p>
<p>Price Waterhouse created Latin American outsourcing arm to serve the two units. It said both it and British Petroleum expected significant cost savings over the deal's lifetime.</p>
</text>
